## 🏗️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React (Vite) + Tailwind CSS |
| Backend API | FastAPI (Python) |
| ML / Data | Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn, Surprise, `implicit` |
| Embeddings | `sentence-transformers` |
| Database | PostgreSQL |
| Experiments | Jupyter, Matplotlib, Seaborn |
| Tooling | Git, GitHub Actions, pytest |

*Stack may change as the project evolves.*

