## 📈 Evaluation

Accuracy alone rewards recommending bestsellers, so Shelfwise tracks both.

**Accuracy**
- RMSE, MAE (rating prediction)
- Precision@K, Recall@K, NDCG@K (ranking)

**Anti-slop metrics**
- **Coverage:** fraction of the catalog that ever gets recommended
- **Novelty / long-tail share:** how many recommendations come from outside the top-popularity tier
- **Intra-list diversity:** average dissimilarity within a recommendation list
- **Popularity bias:** correlation between item popularity and recommendation frequency

The target is a model that stays competitive on accuracy while clearly beating the baseline on coverage and novelty.

