## 🗺️ Roadmap

- [ ] **Phase 1:** Data exploration
- [ ] **Phase 2:** Cleaning and preprocessing
- [ ] **Phase 3:** Collaborative filtering and matrix factorization baselines
- [ ] **Phase 4:** Content-based models (TF-IDF vs. embeddings)
- [ ] **Phase 5:** Hybrid ranker + debiasing/diversity re-ranking
- [ ] **Phase 6:** Explanation generator
- [ ] **Phase 7:** Evaluation report (accuracy + anti-slop metrics)
- [ ] **Phase 8:** Backend API
- [ ] **Phase 9:** Frontend
- [ ] **Phase 10:** Integration, testing, deployment

